<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Takio no Sōran Bushi (Takio Ito)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1988</span><span class="sg-chain-h">modernised version, faster rhythm, new music and words</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Nanchū Sōran (Wakkanai Minami Junior High School, choreography by Jushō Kasuga)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1991</span><span class="sg-chain-h">school dance on Takio Ito's version</span></li></ul></section>
